msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Taiga「Well? Since we've come back here,＿that means you thought of something,＿right?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Y bien? Si volvimos aquí, eso significa＿que se te ocurrió algo, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Ami「Is there really something we can make＿use of～?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿De verdad hay algo que＿podamos aprovechar～?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, I do have a plan.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, sí tengo un plan.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, right.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, cierto.」"

msgid "Ami「Isn't that an overexaggerated pose?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿No es esa una pose demasiado exagerada?」"

msgid "Taiga「Be quiet, StuChi! So, what's your plan?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Cállate, StuChi! Entonces,＿¿cuál es tu plan?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, you see......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, verás......」"

msgid "Taiga「......This better not be more of your＿bullshit this time, got me......?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Más te vale que esta vez no salgas＿con tonterías, ¿me oyes......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, right......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, cierto......」"

msgid "Look, I have tickets to a popular date spot"
msgstr "Tengo entradas para un lugar de citas de moda"

msgid "I'll clean for a bit"
msgstr "Limpiaré un poco"

msgid "Ryuuji「I know! I'll clean for a bit!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Ya sé! ¡Limpiaré un poco!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kitamura's luck in love will naturally＿increase if I do......!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Si lo hago, la suerte de Kitamura＿en el amor aumentará de forma＿natural......!」"

msgid "Taiga「......」"
msgstr "Taiga「......」"

msgid "Ami「......」"
msgstr "Ami「......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......I, I'm obviously kidding...... Haha......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......O-Obviamente estoy bromeando......＿Jaja......」"

msgid "Both「NOT FUNNY!」"
msgstr "Ambas「¡NO TIENE GRACIA!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「S-Sorry. I can't really think of anything,＿so I just......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「P-Perdón. No se me ocurre＿nada, así que solo......」"

msgid "Taiga「We're gonna look around one more＿time! There's gotta be something we＿can use around here!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Vamos a buscar una vez más!＿¡Tiene que haber algo que podamos＿usar por aquí!」"

msgid "Taiga「You're a dog, so dig something up on＿all fours if you have to! Got it!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Eres un perro, así que escarba en＿cuatro patas si hace falta! ¿Entendido?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「G-Got it......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「E-Entendido......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I know! I'll clea......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Ya sé! Limpia......」"

msgid "Taiga「If you say \"clean\" I'll break every last＿one of your Takasu Rods and throw＿them in a fire.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Si dices \"limpiar\", partiré hasta＿el último de tus Bastones Takasu＿y los echaré al fuego.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Ugh, MOTTAINAI! S-Spare them......!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Uf, ¡QUÉ DESPERDICIO!＿¡P-Perdónalos......!」"

msgid "Taiga「If you're a real dog, quit making me＿repeat myself over and over, you＿bonehead!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Si de verdad eres un perro, deja＿de hacerme repetir lo mismo una＿y otra vez, ¡cabeza hueca!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Ngh......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ngh......」"

msgid "Taiga「Anyway, we won't make any progress＿unless we find something. That said,＿get searching already!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Como sea, no avanzaremos nada a menos＿que encontremos algo. ¡Así que ponte＿a buscar de una vez!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「G-Got it......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「E-Entendido......」"

msgid "Ami「*Yawn*～ ......Ami-chan's so boreddd......」"
msgstr "Ami「*Bostezo*～ ......Ami-chan está＿tan aburridaaa......」"

msgid "Taiga「I see...... Ryuuji, I'm gonna say this one＿more time. This isn't a game. This is a＿huge burden in Kitamura-kun's heart.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ya veo...... Ryuuji, te lo diré una vez＿más. Esto no es un juego. Es un gran＿peso en el corazón de Kitamura-kun.」"

msgid "Taiga「And we're sticking our noses into it. Do＿you understand?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Y estamos metiendo las narices＿en esto. ¿Lo entiendes?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「The feng shui in any room can be＿improved dramatically just by tidying＿up! So I'll polish every nook and cranny」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡El feng shui de cualquier cuarto mejora＿drásticamente con solo ordenar! ¡Así＿que puliré cada rincón」"

msgid "Ryuuji「of Kitamura's room with my Takasu＿Rod!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「del cuarto de Kitamura＿con mi Bastón Takasu!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, okay...... Something's wrong with me＿today...... Someone must be possessing＿me and forcing me to pick the wrong」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, está bien...... Algo me pasa＿hoy...... Alguien debe estar poseyéndome＿y obligándome a elegir las opciones」"

msgid "Ryuuji「choices......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「equivocadas......」"

msgid "Taiga「If that was the case, that \"someone\" is＿the biggest bonehead of all. I'll say it as＿many times as you need me to, you」"
msgstr "Taiga「Si así fuera, ese \"alguien\" es el mayor＿cabeza hueca de todos. Te lo diré las＿veces que haga falta, ¡eres un」"

msgid "Taiga「bonehead, bonehead, BONEHEAD!」"
msgstr "Taiga「cabeza hueca, cabeza hueca,＿CABEZA HUECA!」"
